{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/azure-databases/data-api-builder","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:12:11.701Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/azure-databases/data-api-builder/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/azure-databases/data-api-builder/about"},"readme":"## About\nThis repository contains the official container images for Data API builder for Azure Databases.\n\n## Pull specific version of Data API builder\n\n* command\n  * `docker pull mcr.microsoft.com/azure-databases/data-api-builder:<version_tag>`\n\n## What is Data API builder for Azure Databases?\nData API builder for Azure Databases provides modern REST and GraphQL endpoints to your Azure Databases. With Data API builder, database objects can be exposed via REST or GraphQL endpoints so that your data can be \naccessed using modern techniques on any platform, any language, and any device. With an integrated and flexible policy engine, \ngranular security is assured; integrated with Azure SQL, SQL Server, PostgreSQL, MySQL and Cosmos DB, gives developers an efficiency boost like never seen before.\n\nTo learn more about Data API builder for Azure Databases, refer to [docs](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2224253)\n\n## Configuration\nA json config file is required for running the Data API builder runtime engine.\nTo learn how to create the runtime config file, refer to [docs](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2224253)\n\n## Usage\n`docker run -it -v <host-directory>:/App/<container-directory> -p 5000:5000 mcr.microsoft.com/azure-databases/data-api-builder:<tag> --ConfigFileName <configuration-file>`\n\nFor example, if:\n\n- Let's say you are in the directory: `C:/data-api-builder` folder\n- the configuration file you want to use is in the `samples` folder and is named `my-sample-dab-config.json`\n- You would like to use the image with the tag `0.5.*`\n\nthe command to run is the following:\n\n```bash\ndocker run -it -v \"c:/data-api-builder/samples:/App/samples\" -p 5000:5000 mcr.microsoft.com/azure-databases/data-api-builder:0.5.* --ConfigFileName ./samples/my-sample-dab-config.json\n```\n\n## Support\nView open issues in our GitHub repository [here](https://github.com/Azure/data-api-builder/issues?q=is%3Aissue+is%3Aopen). \n\nIf you encounter any bugs with the container image, please file an issue in [GitHub](https://github.com/Azure/data-api-builder/issues/new?assignees=&labels=container).\n\n## Feedback\nIf you have any problems or questions about this image, Please go through our [Support Statement](https://github.com/Azure/data-api-builder/blob/main/SUPPORT.md).\n\n## License\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)\n\nSee our license terms [here](https://github.com/Azure/data-api-builder/blob/main/LICENSE.txt).","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-09-21T20:29:53.0222371+00:00","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":"MIT","links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"3.2M+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"2.1.4-rc","digest":"sha256:f72c37fbbaeb4af2398c77671c697da0c8bd7301a29315965b4549ce61ea9097","pushed":"2026-09-21T20:29:21.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"latest","digest":"sha256:85db5c7f1af9d0bc93af824a0602285880a07dba210854bc68394e08d9d338ac","pushed":"2026-09-01T03:50:07.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":null},{"name":"2.1.3-rc","digest":"sha256:17eea69460c816d4021d4f240558e5d4ed0f931d79271eac7793480d1a98d071","pushed":"2026-08-25T01:22:45.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":null